@<TRIPOS>MOLECULE
graphite_hexagonal
 4 2 1 0 0
SMALL
NO_CHARGES

# Hexagonal graphite (P6_3/mmc, a = 2.4612 A, c = 6.7079 A, gamma = 120 deg).
# Exercises the other common CRYSIN layout: the record placed directly after
# MOLECULE and carrying only the six cell parameters, with no space group or
# setting. Only the two in-cell C-C bonds are declared; the others cross the
# periodic boundary.
@<TRIPOS>CRYSIN
2.4612 2.4612 6.7079 90.0 90.0 120.0

@<TRIPOS>ATOM
      1 C1          0.0000    0.0000    1.6770 C.ar    1  GRA         0.0000
      2 C2          0.0000    0.0000    5.0309 C.ar    1  GRA         0.0000
      3 C3          0.0000    1.4210    1.6770 C.ar    1  GRA         0.0000
      4 C4          1.2306    0.7105    5.0309 C.ar    1  GRA         0.0000
@<TRIPOS>BOND
     1     1     3    ar
     2     2     4    ar
@<TRIPOS>SUBSTRUCTURE
     1  GRA         1 TEMP              0 ****  ****    0 ROOT
